{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/api/books?bibkeys=OLID:OL27166837M,OLID:OL27561668M,OLID:OL32988446M,OLID:OL33485749M,OLID:OL33562979M,OLID:OL40427538M&jscmd=details&format=json","file":"data/metadata2_261025/raw/library-035203486789b96e.json","retrieved":"2026-10-25T17:06:11.133Z","status":200,"data":{"OLID:OL27166837M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL27166837M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27166837M/Does_Santa_exist","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27166837M/Does_Santa_exist","details":{"table_of_contents":[{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Logic","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Mysticism","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Comedy","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Life","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Me and you.","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Philosopher and comedy writer (Futurama, Big Bang Theory) Kaplan tackles a metaphysical paradox: there are some things we dearly believe in that are not universally acknowledged as real. Here, Kaplan shows how philosophy giants Bertrand Russell and Ludwig Wittgenstein strove to smooth over this uncomfortable meeting of the real and unreal--and failed. From there he turns to mysticism's attempts to resolve such paradoxes, surveying Buddhism, Taoism, early Christianity, Theosophy, and even the philosophers at UC Berkeley under whom he studied. Finally, he alights on--surprise--comedy as the ultimate resolution of the fundamental paradoxes of life. Ultimately, Kaplan delves deeper into the implications of this deceptively simple revelation, from how our physical brains work to his own personal confrontations with life's biggest questions: If we're all going to die, what's the point of anything? What is a perfect moment? What can you say about God? Or Santa? The answers in this book will cheer the rest of your life.--Adapted from publisher description."},"local_id":["urn:sfpl:31223112108361","urn:sfpl:31223108212904","urn:sfpl:31223112108379","urn:sfpl:31223112108395"],"lc_classifications":["BD331 .K293 2014","BD331.K293 2014"],"key":"/books/OL27166837M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7597156A","name":"Kaplan, Eric (Television producer)"}],"subtitle":"a philosophical investigation","subjects":["Miscellanea","Immaterialism (Philosophy)","Ontology"],"isbn_13":["9780525954392"],"pagination":"x, 275 pages","source_records":["marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run05.mrc:91279920:3575","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part41.utf8:141415717:887","bwb:9780525954392"],"title":"Does Santa exist?","dewey_decimal_class":["111"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Includes bibliographical references (p. 257-263) and index.\n\nIncludes bibliographical references (pages 257-263) and index."},"number_of_pages":275,"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"lccn":["2014003702"],"isbn_10":["0525954392"],"subject_people":["Santa Claus"],"publish_country":"nyu","publish_date":"2014","by_statement":"Eric Kaplan","oclc_numbers":["883391047"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL19986714W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"latest_revision":3,"revision":3,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2019-07-18T15:37:35.190423"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-12-17T20:19:39.480490"}}},"OLID:OL27561668M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL27561668M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27561668M/Does_Santa_Exist","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27561668M/Does_Santa_Exist","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9016898-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Little, Brown"],"source_records":["amazon:1408706040","bwb:9781408706046"],"title":"Does Santa Exist?","identifiers":{"amazon":["1408706040"]},"isbn_13":["9781408706046"],"covers":[9016898],"physical_format":"paperback","full_title":"Does Santa Exist?","isbn_10":["1408706040"],"key":"/books/OL27561668M","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20351013W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"lc_classifications":["BD331"],"latest_revision":2,"revision":2,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2019-10-26T06:10:24.672035"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-09-18T23:11:27.813704"}}},"OLID:OL32988446M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL32988446M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL32988446M/Does_Santa_exist","preview":"restricted","preview_url":"https://archive.org/details/doessantaexistph0000kapl","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11621339-S.jpg","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"publish_date":"2015","publish_country":"enk","languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7597156A","name":"Kaplan, Eric (Television producer)"}],"oclc_numbers":["931956766"],"dewey_decimal_class":["111"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Includes bibliographical references (pages 257-263) and index."},"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"Metaphysics isn't ordinarily much of a laughing matter. But in the hands of acclaimed comedy writer and scholar Eric Kaplan, a search for the truth about old St. Nick becomes a deeply insightful, laugh-out-loud discussion of the way some things exist but may not really be there. Just like Santa and his reindeer. Even after we outgrow the jolly fellow, the essential paradox persists: There are some things we dearly believe in that are not universally acknowledged as real. In Does Santa Exist? Kaplan shows how philosophy giants Bertrand Russell and Ludwig Wittgenstein strove to smooth over this uncomfortable meeting of the real and unreal - and failed. From there he turns to mysticism's attempts to resolve such paradoxes, surveying Buddhism, Taoism, early Christianity, Theosophy and even the philosophers at UC Berkeley under whom he studied. Finally, this brilliant comic writer alights on - surprise! - comedy as the ultimate resolution of the fundamental paradoxes of life, using examples from The Big Bang Theory, Monty Python's cheese shop and many other pop-culture sources. Kaplan delves deeper into what all this means, from how our physical brains work to his own personal confrontations with life's biggest questions: If we're all going to die, what's the point of anything? What is a perfect moment? What can you say about God? Or Santa? --Publsiher."},"table_of_contents":[{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Logic","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Mysticism","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Comedy","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Life","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"label":"","title":"Me and you.","pagenum":"","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}}],"subjects":["Miscellanea","Ontology","Immaterialism (Philosophy)"],"subject_people":["Santa Claus (Fictitious character)","Santa Claus"],"title":"Does Santa exist?","subtitle":"a philosophical investigation","by_statement":"Eric Kaplan","publishers":["Abacus"],"publish_places":["London"],"isbn_13":["9780349140629"],"isbn_10":["0349140626"],"pagination":"x, 275 pages","number_of_pages":275,"ocaid":"doessantaexistph0000kapl","source_records":["ia:doessantaexistph0000kapl","bwb:9780349140629","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2021-02-03"],"full_title":"Does Santa exist? a philosophical investigation","covers":[11621339],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL19986714W"}],"key":"/books/OL32988446M","lc_classifications":["BD331"],"local_id":["urn:bwbsku:KO-907-322"],"latest_revision":3,"revision":3,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-08-14T07:24:24.868675"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-12-08T23:24:28.847032"}}},"OLID:OL33485749M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL33485749M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33485749M/Does_Santa_Exist","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33485749M/Does_Santa_Exist","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2757573A","name":"Eric Kaplan"}],"isbn_13":["9781408706053"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":176,"publish_date":"2014","publishers":["Little, Brown Book Group Limited"],"source_records":["bwb:9781408706053"],"subjects":["Ontology","Metaphysics","Santa claus","Humor, general"],"title":"Does Santa Exist?","subtitle":"A Philosophical Investigation","full_title":"Does Santa Exist? A Philosophical Investigation","works":[{"key":"/works/OL25157632W"}],"key":"/books/OL33485749M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-09-18T08:40:13.869520"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-09-18T08:40:13.869520"}}},"OLID:OL33562979M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL33562979M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33562979M/Does_Santa_Exist","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33562979M/Does_Santa_Exist","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2757573A","name":"Eric Kaplan"}],"isbn_13":["9781408706039"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"publish_date":"2014","publishers":["Little, Brown Book Group Limited"],"source_records":["bwb:9781408706039","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-03-17"],"title":"Does Santa Exist?","full_title":"Does Santa Exist?","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20351013W"}],"key":"/books/OL33562979M","local_id":["urn:bwbsku:KQ-091-725"],"latest_revision":2,"revision":2,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-09-19T05:12:02.110736"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-12-07T06:30:05.060129"}}},"OLID:OL40427538M":{"bib_key":"OLID:OL40427538M","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL40427538M/Does_Santa_Exist","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL40427538M/Does_Santa_Exist","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"title":"Does Santa Exist?","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2757573A","name":"Eric Kaplan"}],"publish_date":"Oct 27, 2015","source_records":["amazon:0147516420","bwb:9780147516428"],"number_of_pages":288,"publishers":["Plume"],"isbn_10":["0147516420"],"isbn_13":["9780147516428"],"physical_format":"paperback","full_title":"Does Santa Exist? A Philosophical Investigation","subtitle":"A Philosophical Investigation","notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Source title: Does Santa Exist?: A Philosophical Investigation"},"works":[{"key":"/works/OL20351013W"}],"key":"/books/OL40427538M","latest_revision":2,"revision":2,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-11-18T18:09:32.700841"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-11-19T12:23:00.278382"}}}}}